    "// 이렇게 했다\nText(trackingNumber)\n\n// 이렇게 고쳤다\nText(trackingNumber)\n    .textSelection(.enabled)\nButton(\"복사\", systemImage: \"doc.on.doc\") {\n    UIPasteboard.general.string = trackingNumber\n}": {
