    "Menu(\"더보기\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"정렬\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"읽지 않음만\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"보기\") { /* 서브메뉴 */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"모두 삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// 대상 위에서 바로 - 행에는 contextMenu\n.contextMenu { … }": {
      "comment": "On-screen SwiftUI code sample. Translate only Korean comments and string literals; keep Swift code as is.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"More\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"Sort\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"Unread only\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"View\") { /* submenu */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"Delete all\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// Right on the target: contextMenu on the row\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"More\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"Sort\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"Unread only\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"View\") { /* submenu */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"Delete all\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// Right on the target: contextMenu on the row\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"その他\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"並べ替え\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"未読のみ\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"表示\") { /* サブメニュー */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"すべて削除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// 対象の上でそのまま: 行には contextMenu\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"더보기\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"정렬\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"읽지 않음만\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"보기\") { /* 서브메뉴 */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"모두 삭제\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// 대상 위에서 바로 - 행에는 contextMenu\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"更多\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"排序\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"仅未读\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"显示\") { /* 子菜单 */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"全部删除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// 直接作用在对象上：行用 contextMenu\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"更多\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"排序\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"僅未讀\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"顯示\") { /* 子選單 */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"全部刪除\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// 直接作用在物件上：行用 contextMenu\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"Ещё\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"Сортировка\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"Только непрочитанные\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"Вид\") { /* подменю */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"Удалить всё\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// Прямо на объекте: для строки используйте contextMenu\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu(\"Más\", systemImage: \"ellipsis\") {\n    Picker(\"Ordenar\", selection: $sort) { /* … */ }\n    Divider()\n    Toggle(\"Solo no leídos\", isOn: $unreadOnly)\n    Menu(\"Vista\") { /* submenú */ }\n    Divider()\n    Button(\"Eliminar todo\", systemImage: \"trash\", role: .destructive) { … }\n}\n\n// Justo sobre el objetivo: contextMenu en la fila\n.contextMenu { … }"
          }
        }
      }
